From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vitis-AI Telluride <vaiml-build@example.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] xdna-driver: build/install full XRT tree on NPU path

Two related changes to CMake/xrt.cmake (the AIE4/NPU branch). The
AIE2/VE2 path goes through CMake/xrt_ve2.cmake and is unaffected.

1) Drop src/runtime_src/core/tools from XRT_EXCLUDE_SUB_DIRECTORY.

   That directory contains xbutil2, which the upstream CMakeLists.txt
   renames to 'xrt-smi' at install time:

       set(XBUTIL2_NAME "xrt-smi")

   With it excluded, an NPU build of XRT silently produces no
   /usr/bin/xrt-smi -- there is no way to query or validate the device
   on the target. xbtracer and xbmgmt2 stay disabled via their own
   gates (XRT_ENABLE_XBTRACER / XRT_XRT|XRT_ALVEO).

2) Drop EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL from add_subdirectory(${XDNA_XRT_DIR}).

   In CMake >= 3.28, EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL on a subdirectory excludes both
   the targets from `make all` *and* their install() rules from
   `cmake --install`. The result on AIE4 was that the only XRT
   artifacts that ever landed in DESTDIR were the ones referenced by
   the dev-convenience install() lines inside xdna-driver/src/shim/
   itself:

       image/usr/lib/libxrt_driver_xdna.so*       (canonical install)
       image/bins/lib/libxrt_core.so*             (XDNA_BIN_DIR copy)
       image/bins/lib/libxrt_coreutil.so*         (XDNA_BIN_DIR copy)
       image/bins/lib/libxrt_driver_xdna.so*      (XDNA_BIN_DIR copy)

   Everything that XRT itself installs -- ${libdir}/libxrt_core.so*,
   ${libdir}/libxrt_coreutil.so*, /usr/bin/xrt-smi, /usr/include/xrt/*,
   /usr/lib/pkgconfig/xrt.pc, cmake config files -- was missing.
   Downstream recipes (e.g. vvas-core) then fail do_configure with
   "Run-time dependency xrt found: NO (tried pkgconfig)".

   The AIE2/VE2 wrapper (xrt_ve2.cmake) already uses a plain
   add_subdirectory(...) with no EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL, which is why AIE2
   builds have been producing the full XRT tree all along.
---
 CMake/xrt.cmake | 3 +--
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/CMake/xrt.cmake b/CMake/xrt.cmake
--- a/CMake/xrt.cmake
+++ b/CMake/xrt.cmake
@@ -5,15 +5,14 @@
 set(XRT_EXCLUDE_SUB_DIRECTORY
   src/runtime_src/core/pcie/emulation
   src/runtime_src/core/pcie/windows
   src/runtime_src/core/pcie/driver
   src/runtime_src/core/pcie/tools
   src/runtime_src/core/pcie/noop
 
-  src/runtime_src/core/tools
   src/runtime_src/core/edge
 
   src/runtime_src/tools
   src/runtime_src/xocl
   src/runtime_src/ert
   src/runtime_src/xrt
 
@@ -36,4 +35,4 @@ set(XDNA_XRT_DIR xrt/src)
 set(XRT_SOURCE_DIR "${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/${XDNA_XRT_DIR}")
 set(XRT_BINARY_DIR "${CMAKE_CURRENT_BINARY_DIR}/${XDNA_XRT_DIR}")
 
-add_subdirectory(${XDNA_XRT_DIR} EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL)
+add_subdirectory(${XDNA_XRT_DIR})
-- 
